WEBVTT

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:32.920
I'm back, Tokimune.

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.470
Welcome back!

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:37.430
Welcome back, Sis!

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:59.970
I haven't had that dream in a while.

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:08.080
Tokimune!

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:10.130
There's no time to sleep!

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.540
We've been given leave!

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:14.130
We get to go to Bellhals!

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.680
Bellhals?

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:22.180
The Independent 8th Attack Unit

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:26.810
contributed greatly to the neutralization of an Ingelmia terminal on the front lines.

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:33.020
However, the two armies continued to face off at various places in Arandas.

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:35.940
One of them was an area known as Bellhals,

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:40.160
near the Govitz Plains, which was leased to a third nation known as Wild Reveld.

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:45.080
Bellhals
Bellhals

00:01:56.380 --> 00:02:00.390
So we're on Cape Sagara right now,

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:05.270
and Bellhals is the land-tied island we're going to from here.

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:07.810
I know that,

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:11.980
but Bellhals is a resort for rich people from Wild Reveld, right?

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:15.190
You were asleep in geography class, weren't you?

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:20.780
More precisely, it's land that Arandas leashes to Wild Reveld.

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:22.370
"Leases."

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:25.450
It's still basically a resort, right?

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:26.950
Why are we going to a place like that?

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:28.870
To resupply.

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:32.250
The supply units can't spare the trip out here.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:39.260
A lot of the goods imported from Wild Reveld come through Bellhals.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:41.470
Oh... I didn't know that.

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:43.800
It's classified, in theory.

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:45.600
But you just told me!

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:48.470
It's more or less an open secret now.

00:02:48.470 --> 00:02:52.600
We got a message telling us to resupply with the goods unloaded at the port.

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:54.770
I see.

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:59.070
The ship's late, so we've got a little free time, right?

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:01.700
That was nice of the captain.

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:04.160
That's right.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:07.410
I'd like to believe it's because he cares about his men.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:10.210
You go on, too.

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.670
There's nothing important to do until the supplies get here,

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:15.790
and you've got permission.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.000
Have some fun for a change.

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:20.220
Okay!

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:21.800
Thanks!

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:24.590
I'm going to meet the person in charge of the supplies.

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:26.640
Watch the place while I'm gone.

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:33.140
Captain, wouldn't it be better for me to go?

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:37.650
I want to get some sunlight.

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:41.070
All right.

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:43.320
Leave everything here to me.

00:03:55.710 --> 00:04:00.210
Hey, is the spot you recommended in there, Jamie?

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:03.470
Huh? Oh, no, this is something else.

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:05.220
My recommendation is...

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.220
This spa.

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:11.220
I always wanted to check it out if I ever went to Bellhals.

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:13.390
Wow, it's really gorgeous...

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:14.730
It looks expensive!

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:16.520
Not a problem!

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:20.440
My company gave me a coupon!

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:23.400
Company benefits, huh?

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:26.450
Okay, everyone listen up.

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:32.330
Bellhals is officially a neutral zone, so no military activity is permitted.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:33.910
That's why you're in plain clothes.

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:36.330
Be careful, everyone.

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:37.330
Sir!

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:40.840
Also, some of you seem to think this is free time,

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:44.010
but you're simply on standby until the resupply is ready.

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:45.380
No drinking.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:50.260
Sorry I'm late.

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:52.600
Anything you want to say over there?

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.140
No, ma'am!

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:55.060
Good.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:57.230
Everybody here?

00:04:57.810 --> 00:04:59.060
Oh, sorry.

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:00.480
Tokimune's not here yet.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.030
What's keeping him?

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:08.320
Yes?

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:11.660
Oh, hello, Mr. Suguro.

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:13.450
Yes, it's me.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:16.500
Yes.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.460
<i>What!?!?</i>

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:28.800
An update for Argevollen, huh?

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:31.600
You couldn't do it after you got back?

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:36.020
He wants it done now.

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:39.650
If he had called after we left, I could've gotten out of it...

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:44.230
My plain clothes were getting moldy in the bottom of my bag.

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:45.820
I borrowed these from the chief.

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:48.700
No wonder they look lousy on you.

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:52.910
What, did you want to go this sauna that badly?

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:53.950
Spa.

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:56.160
Not that badly.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:57.870
Then does it really matter?

00:05:58.500 --> 00:05:59.500
It does!

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:02.040
I really wanted to go!

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:04.460
It's been my aspiration to go since I was hired!

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:06.840
I kept that coupon in my wallet the whole time!

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:08.630
Get it?!

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:10.300
Y-yeah...

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:24.110
I'm going to Bellhals after this is over.

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:25.020
You want a lift?

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:29.030
I'm borrowing Seeker's bike, so we'd have to ride it together.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:32.570
That's fine! I'll ride with you, and a third person if I have to!

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:33.120
I'll go!

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:38.370
Data! Come on, data!

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.540
Oh, gulls...

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:42.500
Fly, gulls...

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:46.840
With the innocence of a girl dancing on a silver platter of candy...

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:11.570
Is this it?

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:14.530
It might be even more gorgeous than I'd imagined.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:16.580
Is this okay?

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.330
Can we really go in?

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:22.790
If this coupon is real, we'll probably be okay.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:24.380
Why are you just standing there?

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:25.460
We're going inside.

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:29.880
That's right. We're customers.

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:31.590
Let's hold our heads high.

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:33.680
Take a good look.

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:35.760
That's real girl power!

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:40.730
You know...

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:45.390
If we can't go drinking, isn't there anywhere else we men can go?

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:49.230
Nope.

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:52.820
What about you? Why are you here?

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:56.070
I'm keeping you guys sompany.

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:59.290
Thanks.

00:07:59.800 --> 00:08:00.760
Say...

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:02.750
What are our chicks doing, anyways?

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:05.250
Going to a spa, they said.

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:07.790
It looked really fancy.

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:09.960
A "spa?" Wazzat?

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:12.050
Basically a bath.

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:13.380
A bath?

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:15.590
I see. A bath, huh?

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:18.890
I'm sorry, sir, but we can't take Ingelmian money...

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:21.310
What? Seriously?!

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:23.980
Arandas is practically dead. Our money should be worth more!

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:26.150
What the hell, man?

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:28.190
This island lets Ingelmia troops in, too.

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:29.480
There are places in town that welcome both nations.

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.280
You knew that when you came, didn't you?

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:32.740
Yes.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:34.400
Well, let's drink.

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:36.570
Excuse me!

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:43.000
Come here at 1600 on the planned arrival day...

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:45.000
Fill out the paperwork,

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:50.000
and we can give you the items at 0900 the following day.

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:53.510
Can we shorten the time required for the paperwork to be processed?

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:54.920
Nope, can't.

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:57.680
Our cargo always comes last.

00:08:57.680 --> 00:08:59.010
You know that, right?

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:02.850
Besides, even if it shows up a little early,

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:05.850
it won't change the fact that you're losing the war.

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:09.440
You guys should know that better than anyone.

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:16.280
If we lose the war, your job disappears.

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:21.370
A single minute may turn the tide of a battle.

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:23.450
Make haste.

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:31.090
That guy's completely useless, isn't he?

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:35.510
Every time I see him at work, he pisses me off.

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:39.430
He's like everything that's wrong with Arandas in one package.

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:42.600
So this is where you were, Quasimodo.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.520
That's my line.

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:47.020
You didn't come to my territory

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:51.360
and plan on leaving without saying hi, did you, Marshal?

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:55.650
Don't call me that.

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:57.030
I'm a lieutenant.

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:08.580
Faster, faster!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:09.960
Faster!

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:11.290
Faster, faster!

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:12.420
<i>Faster!</i>

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:16.460
Say, what will the update to Argevollen change?

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:18.920
Um...

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:24.140
Additional display fields during use,

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:26.600
Improved safe mode activation methods,

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:30.310
And approximately a 3% increase in feedback precision.

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:35.980
Isn't it nice how this thing just keeps steadily improving?

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:39.110
Can't someone update <i>me?</i>

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:41.950
I kid, I kid.

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:45.080
I know. I can't ask somebody else to solve my problems.

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:46.700
I just need to keep improving.

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:48.040
Aren't you?

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:50.920
Growing.

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:54.090
You've grown a little, haven't you?

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:58.300
Have I?

00:10:58.300 --> 00:10:59.800
Quit grinning, idiot.

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:23.570
Do you have a light?

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:29.750
Sorry, but I quit smoking yesterday.

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:31.120
I see.

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:39.420
That's a shame, Private.

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:41.470
Gorzy?

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:42.220
Yes.

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:47.260
Welcome to Wild Reveld, Ingelmian friend.

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:48.600
How does it look?

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:53.190
Every single part is in transit,

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:57.690
and we're all set to begin construction after arrival.

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:03.570
Bellhals, huh?

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:07.120
I'll have my fun here.

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:21.340
Seeker, the update's done, so I'd like Tokimune to give me a ride...

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:24.840
All right!

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:26.970
Be careful.

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:28.930
Don't be in too much of a rush.

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:29.680
Right!

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:43.110
Tokimune Susumu.

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:45.280
J-J-Jamie Hazaford!

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:47.240
How long are you staying?

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:48.240
Umm...

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:51.240
Until evening! So please hurry!

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:02.630
A dead end.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:04.130
Oh, so we should've turned at—

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:05.550
Here's fine, then.

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:06.840
I'll run there.

00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:13.770
Hello? Hikaru?

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:18.850
Sorry.

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:20.900
We're getting a massage.

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:24.110
I'm on my way there now.

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:25.360
Um...

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:27.530
About that...

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:32.990
We told the staff here that another person

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:34.660
would be coming...

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:40.880
But they said they're all booked up...

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:48.840
We asked them, but

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:50.390
it looks like it's not happening.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:53.390
I'm really sorry.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:54.810
I see.

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:56.100
No, it's fine.

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:57.890
You guys enjoy yourselves.

00:13:57.890 --> 00:14:01.060
I can come back anytime.

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:03.820
Later, then!

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:21.880
Jamie!

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:26.010
Did the sauna not work out?

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:27.670
Spa.

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:31.260
It's not like it's the only place in town, right?

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:37.430
I've looked forward to it for so long; there's no way I can go elsewhere,

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:41.060
and it's the only place my company's coupon is any good.

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:43.900
Why do you want to go so badly?

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:47.280
Because it's really ritzy,

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:49.150
and it looks like I could relax there.

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:51.110
But it's basically a sauna, right?

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:53.370
What?

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:58.160
Nothing. I forgot, you're just an idiot.

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:04.130
Hey... What is it?

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:07.210
Then let's go ride a mini Trail Krieger!

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:10.930
I saw it on an amusement park sign back there.

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:14.390
I've loved Mini-Kries since I was a kid.

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:18.180
Don't you pilot a huge Krieger now?

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:21.100
I'm sure you'll love them, Jamie.

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:23.190
I'm sure I won't!

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:32.570
Really, this is even better.

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:35.200
How was I supposed to know they were closed?

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:37.530
Oh, fine.

00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:40.200
Want to go to the aquarium?

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:42.710
I think the book said it was pretty good.

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:47.710
Hurry up! The dolphin show starts in five minutes!

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:49.510
Seriously?

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:51.170
We've gotta hurry, then!

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:58.890
That book didn't mention on which days they're closed on, huh?

00:15:58.890 --> 00:15:59.970
Shut up.

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:02.060
It's not so bad.

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:04.560
This place is wide open and pretty.

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:07.610
That has nothing to do with the aquarium.

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:09.320
Then where do you want to go?

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:11.280
It's your turn to suggest something.

00:16:13.210 --> 00:16:14.740
Uh...

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:19.990
I know! There was a sign about an old... ship...

00:16:20.740 --> 00:16:22.750
How about an outlet store?

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:30.170
A museum! I saw a sign!

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:35.760
This place is open.

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:36.970
As if!

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:54.530
Mackerel sandwiches. My treat.

00:16:56.950 --> 00:16:58.070
Thanks.

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:01.830
This is good.

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:04.160
This place is famous for them, apparently.

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:12.050
I lose.

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:13.260
Huh? What?

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:22.430
That's the ship with our supplies, right?

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:24.220
Yeah. I think so.

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:49.670
In the end, all we got out of that were mackerel sandwiches.

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:52.170
I'll just leave it at that.

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:15.650
Here you go, miss.

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:18.030
Thank you.

00:18:19.610 --> 00:18:20.410
Um...

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:24.830
Are you here to sightsee?

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:27.790
Yes.

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:29.500
Why?

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:34.420
Um, if there are any good places around here, I'd like to know about them.

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:40.050
We're going to make some money at the casino.

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:42.930
I can't recommend that to you guys.

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:44.680
Goodbye.

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:47.060
Thank you!

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:55.900
Those people are soldiers.

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:57.400
How do you know?

00:18:58.030 --> 00:19:01.450
I can just tell. It's the air about them.

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:05.370
A date, huh? They're sure taking it easy.

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:07.490
Probably just some spoiled rich brats.

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:09.160
The man was a soldier.

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:12.080
He knew what we were, too.

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:14.460
We're moving up the plan.

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:53.040
Go back! Back there!

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:58.050
Hey!

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:06.140
Hey!

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:08.430
Over here!

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:26.570
Take a photo here to remember today!

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:28.830
What a pain.

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:31.750
It's just pushing a button.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:33.580
Here.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:39.410
Say cheese.

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:43.090
Hey! There's no way I'm in that!

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:44.300
Take it for real!

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:45.760
Fine.

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:49.140
I guess this way is better.

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:54.020
Say something before you take it.

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:55.810
Sorry, I'll take it again.

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:57.100
Huh?

00:20:58.310 --> 00:20:59.270
What?

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:10.660
Is this...

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:15.910
It's the last picture my sister sent to me.

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:17.750
What? Then...

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:31.180
My sister was here.

00:23:37.600 --> 00:23:41.020
Rematch
